</section>
<div class="empty-state card border-0 shadow-sm">
    <div class="card-body text-center py-5 px-4">
        <div class="empty-state-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</div>
        <h2 class="h4 mt-3">A clean start</h2>
        <p class="text-secondary mx-auto mb-0" style="max-width: 34rem;">No accounts, transactions, investments, or financial data have been added. The application foundation is in place and ready for its first module.</p>
    </div>
</div>
